# Phase 71 follow-up — the greeter background is a user-personal
# asset, not a shared canonical one. Drop your image at
# `background.png` (preferred) or `background.bmp` and xtask will
# stage it at `/etc/greeter/background.{png,bmp}` on the data disk.
# Supported formats: PNG, 24-bit RGB BMP, 32-bit BGRA BMP. The
# greeter scales-to-fit, so any aspect ratio works.
background.png
background.bmp
